@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif

participant "User / CLI / UI" as User
participant "IgnoreListWindowController\n/ CLI" as UI
participant "CascadeEngine\n(Preferences)" as Engine
participant "NSUserDefaults" as Defaults
participant "WindowWatcher" as Watcher
participant "macOS WindowServer\n& NSWorkspace" as WS

== 1. Configuration & Persistence ==
User -> UI: Add / Remove / Clear Ignored App (e.g. "Slack")
UI -> Engine: addIgnoredApp: / setIgnoredApps:
Engine -> Defaults: Write array to "ignoredApps"
Engine -> UI: Return updated list
UI -> Watcher: Update watcher.excludeApps

== 2. Dynamic Observer Detachment & Lifecycle Suppression ==
Watcher -> Watcher: Compare active observers with excludeApps
opt App newly ignored
    Watcher -> WS: Detach AX observers for ignored PID
    note over Watcher: Prevents spurious AX notifications\nfrom ignored windows
end

== 3. Event Filtering During Execution ==
WS -> Watcher: App Lifecycle Event (Launch, Terminate, Hide, Unhide)
Watcher -> Watcher: isAppExcluded(appName)?
alt App is in excludeApps
    Watcher -> Watcher: Suppress notification (no re-cascade scheduled)
else App is not excluded
    Watcher -> Watcher: scheduleDebouncedChange (350ms)
end

== 4. Cascade Window Collection & Geometry Execution ==
User -> Engine: Trigger Cascade (Menu, Hotkey, or CLI)
Engine -> Engine: Read [CascadeEngine ignoredApps]
Engine -> WS: Query on-screen standard windows
Engine -> Engine: Filter out windows matching ignoredApps
Engine -> WS: Apply cascade layout only to non-ignored windows
note over WS: Ignored application windows\nretain current size and position untouched

@enduml
